<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Haste</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 29), Conjurer (guild level 30)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast haste &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast haste</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Makes the target much faster, twice as fast as quicken does, so they strike 
far more often in a fight. Unlike quicken, you can cast it in the middle of a 
fight. The better your creation sphere, the longer it lasts: from half a 
minute to almost two minutes.
</p><p>Haste, quicken and slow replace each other: only the last one cast on someone 
holds. So haste also lifts a slow. It is also found on potions, wands and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Quicken</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Slow</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>